    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in fragmented worlds where damned souls seek to escape their fate, in this dark fantasy Action RPG, you control <strong>Reng Azure</strong>, a warrior resurrected by <strong>Termotellas</strong>, the guardian of souls. Guided by your raven-shaped mentor through the icy city of Tartarius, you must eliminate fugitive souls while surviving the deadly cold. Find the 7 master keys, free the fearsome Tartariuno and defeat him to save your own damned soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique movement system </strong>-\u00a0Teleportation movement in 4 directions - no traditional jumping, just pure strategy for tactical combat and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raven Summon</strong> - Summon a raven to attack your toughest enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raven Transformation</strong> - Soar through the skies and explore new perspectives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Teleportation</strong> - Instantly move in 4 directions during combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression System</strong> - Upgrade tree to evolve your skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extreme Survival</strong> - Find bonfires or succumb to the deadly cold of Tartarius</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration</strong> - Fragmented worlds in dark and detailed pixel art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey through the dark dimensions of Tartarius ends with the final showdown against the Tartariuno. Every choice shapes your destiny in this adventure of redemption and survival.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in fragmented worlds where damned souls seek to escape their fate, in this dark fantasy Action RPG, you control <strong>Reng Azure</strong>, a warrior resurrected by <strong>Termotellas</strong>, the guardian of souls. Guided by your raven-shaped mentor through the icy city of Tartarius, you must eliminate fugitive souls while surviving the deadly cold. Find the 7 master keys, free the fearsome Tartariuno and defeat him to save your own damned soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique movement system </strong>-\u00a0Teleportation movement in 4 directions - no traditional jumping, just pure strategy for tactical combat and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raven Summon</strong> - Summon a raven to attack your toughest enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raven Transformation</strong> - Soar through the skies and explore new perspectives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Teleportation</strong> - Instantly move in 4 directions during combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression System</strong> - Upgrade tree to evolve your skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extreme Survival</strong> - Find bonfires or succumb to the deadly cold of Tartarius</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration</strong> - Fragmented worlds in dark and detailed pixel art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey through the dark dimensions of Tartarius ends with the final showdown against the Tartariuno. Every choice shapes your destiny in this adventure of redemption and survival.</p>",
